    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Lufthansa international flights operate from **Terminal 2** at BLR. If you are heading there, please follow the international departure signs for the correct check-in and security area. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Lufthansa** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - International Departures &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/airline-partners-information)">
      <data key="d0">support_response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">Lufthansa international flights operate from **Terminal 2**</data>
