    <node id="Porter service">
      <data key="d0">passenger_query</data>
      <data key="d1">Porter service</data>
      <data key="d2">Porter service</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. The Porter Service at BLR Airport provides professional baggage assistance to help you move comfortably through the terminal, whether you are arriving or departing. It is especially helpful for families, senior citizens, passengers with multiple or heavy bags, and anyone who would like a smoother airport journey. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Porter Service** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerbside / Check-in / Baggage Claim support &gt; This service helps carry and transport your luggage from the kerbside to the check-in counters for departures, or from baggage claim to the exit gate for arrivals. It can be customized as per your requirement, and up to 3 bags per porter are allowed. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/cbb-services-listing) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Porter Service** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Kerbside / Check-in / Baggage Claim support &gt; This service helps carry and transport your luggage from the kerbside to the check-in counters for departures, or from baggage claim to the exit gate for arrivals. It can be customized as per your requirement, and up to 3 bags per porter are allowed. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/care-by-blr/porter) If you would like, I can also share the booking contact for porter service.">
      <data key="d0">support_response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">The Porter Service at BLR Airport provides professional baggage assistance</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Porter Service">
      <data key="d0">airport_service</data>
      <data key="d1">Porter Service</data>
      <data key="d2">Porter Service at BLR Airport</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="1 - Kerbside / Check-in / Baggage Claim support">
      <data key="d0">location_zone</data>
      <data key="d1">1 - Kerbside / Check-in / Baggage Claim </data>
      <data key="d2">Terminal 1 - Kerbside / Check-in / Baggage Claim support</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
