    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. At present, BMTC is operating select Vayu Vajra routes, and the updated timings can change based on the route. For the latest schedule, please check BMTC’s official website. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Vayu Vajra** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Transport &gt; The BMTC Vayu Vajra AC bus service is an efficient and inexpensive way to travel to and from the city. It accepts both cash and UPI payments upon boarding. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/airport-VayuVajra) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Vayu Vajra** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Transport &gt; The BMTC Vayu Vajra AC bus service is an efficient and inexpensive way to travel to and from the city. It accepts both cash and UPI payments upon boarding. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/airport-VayuVajra) For route-wise updated timings, please visit BMTC’s official schedule page: **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://mybmtc.karnataka.gov.in/english)">
      <data key="d0">support_response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">Vayu Vajra AC bus service</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
