    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Yes, Meet &amp; Assist is available for inter-terminal movement between Terminal 1 and Terminal 2. It is designed to support transfer passengers and can help with terminal navigation, security checks, gate transfers, and other airport formalities for a smoother journey. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **CBB Meet and Assist** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Inter-terminal transfer support between Terminal 1 &amp; Terminal 2 &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/care-by-blr/meet-and-assist) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **CBB Meet and Assist** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Inter-terminal transfer support between Terminal 1 &amp; Terminal 2 &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/care-by-blr/meet-and-assist) If you’d like, I can also help with the shuttle timing and pickup points between T1 and T2.">
