    <edge source="why sg-205 delayed" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited, I am still learning, so please reach out to customer support at **+91-80-22012001** or **+91-80-66785555**, message us via WhatsApp at **+91-8884998888**, or visit **[Airline Partners Information | Airlines at Bangalore Airport](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/airline-partners-information)** for the most accurate details and direct assistance regarding your airline." id="triggers">
      <data key="d4">triggers</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Lufthansa international flights operate from **Terminal 2** at BLR. If you are heading there, please follow the international departure signs for the correct check-in and security area. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Lufthansa** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - International Departures &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/airline-partners-information)" target="Lufthansa" id="mentions">
      <data key="d4">mentions</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Lufthansa international flights operate from **Terminal 2** at BLR. If you are heading there, please follow the international departure signs for the correct check-in and security area. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Lufthansa** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - International Departures &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/airline-partners-information)" target="2" id="mentions">
      <data key="d4">mentions</data>
