    <edge source="Ez pass" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. EZPass by BLR is a PreSecure Lane that lets you choose a preferred time window to join the security check queue at Terminal 1, Zone D. It is a timed entry pass for the queue only, so it does not skip or fast-track security screening. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **EZPass by BLR** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Zone D security checkpoint, Level 0 &gt; You can book a slot through the BLR Pulse app after completing web check-in. Entry to the queue starts 4 hours before scheduled departure, and bookings are not allowed within 60 minutes of departure. Please keep your QR code and boarding pass ready when you arrive. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/ezpass) If you would like, I can also help you with how to book it step by step." id="triggers">
      <data key="d4">triggers</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. EZPass by BLR is a PreSecure Lane that lets you choose a preferred time window to join the security check queue at Terminal 1, Zone D. It is a timed entry pass for the queue only, so it does not skip or fast-track security screening. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **EZPass by BLR** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Zone D security checkpoint, Level 0 &gt; You can book a slot through the BLR Pulse app after completing web check-in. Entry to the queue starts 4 hours before scheduled departure, and bookings are not allowed within 60 minutes of departure. Please keep your QR code and boarding pass ready when you arrive. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/ezpass) If you would like, I can also help you with how to book it step by step." target="PreSecure Lane - EZPass by BLR" id="describes">
      <data key="d4">describes</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="PreSecure Lane - EZPass by BLR" target="1 - Zone D" id="located_at">
      <data key="d4">located_at</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
