    <edge source="How to book porter service?" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. You can book the Porter Service at BLR Airport through Care by BLR. For reservations, please call **080-66785566**. The service is available for both arriving and departing passengers, and it helps with baggage movement so your journey feels much smoother and less tiring. **Porter Service** &gt; **Care by BLR Porter Service** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 &amp; Terminal 2 - BLR Airport &gt; Professional baggage assistance is available for passengers who need help moving luggage from **kerbside to check-in counters** for departures, or from **baggage claim to exit gate** for arrivals. It is especially helpful for families, senior citizens, passengers with heavy bags, and those who want a more comfortable airport experience. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/care-by-blr/porter) &gt; **Meet And Assist** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 &amp; Terminal 2 - BLR Airport &gt; Senior citizens, children, and passengers with reduced mobility can also use concierge and porter support. For departures, the meeting point is the **kiosk on the kerb**, and staff will escort you to the check-in counter. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/meet-assist) If you’d like, I can also help you with the porter service contact details or explain where to find the kiosk at the airport." id="triggers">
      <data key="d4">triggers</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. You can book the Porter Service at BLR Airport through Care by BLR. For reservations, please call **080-66785566**. The service is available for both arriving and departing passengers, and it helps with baggage movement so your journey feels much smoother and less tiring. **Porter Service** &gt; **Care by BLR Porter Service** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 &amp; Terminal 2 - BLR Airport &gt; Professional baggage assistance is available for passengers who need help moving luggage from **kerbside to check-in counters** for departures, or from **baggage claim to exit gate** for arrivals. It is especially helpful for families, senior citizens, passengers with heavy bags, and those who want a more comfortable airport experience. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/care-by-blr/porter) &gt; **Meet And Assist** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 &amp; Terminal 2 - BLR Airport &gt; Senior citizens, children, and passengers with reduced mobility can also use concierge and porter support. For departures, the meeting point is the **kiosk on the kerb**, and staff will escort you to the check-in counter. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/meet-assist) If you’d like, I can also help you with the porter service contact details or explain where to find the kiosk at the airport." target="Care by BLR Porter Service" id="describes">
      <data key="d4">describes</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
